Package: amdprsr
Type: Project
Title: Polygenic risk score for AMD and its ancestry portability in 1000 Genomes
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Learning project. Builds a PRS for age-related macular degeneration
    from IAMDGC 2016 GWAS summary statistics and evaluates it across the five
    1000 Genomes Phase 3 super-populations. This file is the package manifest
    that renv snapshots (snapshot.type = "explicit"); it is not an R package.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
